From b778fbfc8b0e9cb2fc6888495c4498a5956bac63 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gavin John <gavinnjohn@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 19:34:14 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 08/36] demux: asf: do not dereference the file properties when
 they are gone

DemuxEnd() leaves p_sys->p_fp NULL, which happens when a chained header
fails to re-initialise: Demux() spots what looks like a new ASF header at
the end of the current stream, tears the old one down and cannot build
the replacement. The demux object stays open and the input keeps polling
it.

DEMUX_GET_POSITION is reached in that state. Its two guards do not help -
i_time is not reset by the teardown so it is not VLC_TICK_INVALID, and
i_length is zero, which is exactly the branch that falls through to
demux_vaControlHelper() and reads p_fp->i_min_data_packet_size.

The default case a few lines below makes the same call and guards the
same dereference with a ternary, so treat this one the same way. It is a
crash rather than a failed control: MainLoopStatistics() issues
DEMUX_GET_POSITION every 250 ms and carries on doing so after the end of
the stream.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 modules/demux/asf/asf.c | 7 ++++++-
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/modules/demux/asf/asf.c b/modules/demux/asf/asf.c
index 2ab028f2cc..1862faa818 100644
--- a/modules/demux/asf/asf.c
+++ b/modules/demux/asf/asf.c
@@ -523,11 +523,16 @@ static int Control( demux_t *p_demux, int i_query, va_list args )
             *pf = p_sys->i_time / (double)p_sys->i_length;
             return VLC_SUCCESS;
         }
+        /* p_fp is NULL once DemuxEnd() has run, which happens when a chained
+         * header fails to re-initialise. The default case below guards the
+         * same dereference; this one did not, and the input polls
+         * DEMUX_GET_POSITION every 250 ms. */
         return demux_vaControlHelper( p_demux->s,
                                        __MIN( INT64_MAX, p_sys->i_data_begin ),
                                        __MIN( INT64_MAX, p_sys->i_data_end ),
                                        __MIN( INT64_MAX, p_sys->i_bitrate ),
-                                       __MIN( INT16_MAX, p_sys->p_fp->i_min_data_packet_size ),
+                                       ( p_sys->p_fp ) ?
+                                       __MIN( INT16_MAX, p_sys->p_fp->i_min_data_packet_size ) : 1,
                                        i_query, args );
 
     case DEMUX_SET_POSITION:
